y,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><span class=\"title-counter\">[005]</span></div><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><h2 class=\"title\">Roadmap</h2></div><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-lg mt-3 max-w-xl italic font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground/60\">A roadmap where I share the experiences I&#x27;ve gained throughout my software journey and the technologies I&#x27;ve learned.</p></div><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform] mt-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-border/60 bg-card/55 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground shadow-[3px_3px_0_var(--ink)]\"><span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--coral)]\"></span><span>Milestone <!-- -->01<!-- --> /<!-- --> <!-- -->05</span></div></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-border/40 -translate-x-1/2\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-linear-to-b from-primary via-primary to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(var(--primary),0.5)] -translate-x-1/2 z-10\" style=\"transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:50% 0% 0\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full gap-8 md:gap-24 relative z-20\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between w-full flex-row\"><div class=\"w-[calc(50%-3rem)] hidden md:block\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full border bg-background z-20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:var(--coral);transform:scale(1.12)\"><div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 md:w-3 md:h-3 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--coral)]\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:scale(1.25)\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] pl-16 md:pl-0 relative group\"><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden border p-8 text-left backdrop-blur-md md:p-10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-background border-primary/70 bg-card shadow-[8px_8px_0_var(--coral)] md:text-right\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-primary origin-right\" style=\"transform:none\"></div><span class=\"max-sm:hidden text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-muted-foreground uppercase flex mb-4 md:justify-end\">01</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tighter font-serif italic font-semibold text-foreground uppercase mt-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-500\">2020</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-sm ml-0 md:max-w-md\" style=\"margin-left:auto\">I joined REVA University to pursue a B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering. I learned the fundamentals of programming and began building personal projects with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6 md:justify-end\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">HTML</span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">CSS</span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">JavaScript</span></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[10rem] font-black italic text-foreground/3 select-none pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 -left-12\">20</div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between w-full flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"w-[calc(50%-3rem)] hidden md:block\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full border bg-background z-20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:var(--border);transform:none\"><div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 md:w-3 md:h-3 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--coral)]\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transform:none\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] pl-16 md:pl-0 relative group\"><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden border p-8 text-left backdrop-blur-md md:p-10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-background border-border/50 bg-secondary/5 hover:border-foreground/50 hover:bg-card/75 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0_var(--ink)] md:text-left\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 origin-left bg-primary\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><span class=\"max-sm:hidden text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-muted-foreground uppercase flex mb-4 md:justify-start\">02</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tighter font-serif italic font-semibold text-foreground uppercase mt-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-500\">2024</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-sm ml-0 md:max-w-md\" style=\"margin-left:0\">I joined EXA AG as a Software Developer Intern, working on OTP (Operational Transfer Pricing), a product built with React. After four months, I converted to a full-time Software Developer role in the same organization.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6 justify-start\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">React</span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">JavaScript</span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">OTP</span></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[10rem] font-black italic text-foreground/3 select-none pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 -right-12 text-right\">24</div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between w-full flex-row\"><div class=\"w-[calc(50%-3rem)] hidden md:block\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full border bg-background z-20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:var(--border);transform:none\"><div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 md:w-3 md:h-3 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--coral)]\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transform:none\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] pl-16 md:pl-0 relative group\"><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden border p-8 text-left backdrop-blur-md md:p-10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-background border-border/50 bg-secondary/5 hover:border-foreground/50 hover:bg-card/75 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0_var(--ink)] md:text-right\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-primary origin-right\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><span class=\"max-sm:hidden text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-muted-foreground uppercase flex mb-4 md:justify-end\">03</span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 relative z-10\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tighter font-serif italic font-semibold text-foreground uppercase mt-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-500\">2024</h3><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-sm ml-0 md:max-w-md\" style=\"margin-left:auto\">As a full-time developer at EXA AG, I continued contributing to OTP and strengthened my experience building production-ready interfaces and working within an enterprise product team.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6 md:justify-end\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">React</span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border/40 bg-background/50 shadow-sm\">TypeScript</span></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[10rem] font-black italic text-foreground/3 select-none pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 -left-12\">24</div></button></div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between w-full flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"w-[calc(50%-3rem)] hidden md:block\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 md:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full border bg-background z-20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" style=\"border-color:var(--border);transform:none\"><div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 md:w-3 md:h-3 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--coral)]\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transform:none\"></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] pl-16 md:pl-0 relative group\"><div class=\"will-change-[opacity,transform]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden