\",\"script\",\"script-1\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3mtra2w0f1qyc.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$19\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@1a\"}]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"children\":\"$L1c\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$19\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L1e\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\n1f:I[34529,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1346rvmy85031.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3-douy02js0gw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/32da746qiqsu9.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1jqljfdc-6j9b.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/31ivmtzqsk77g.js\"],\"LanguageProvider\"]\n20:T5cf,Hi, I'm **Soumyajit Basak**, a Software Developer at **EXA AG** in Bengaluru. I started my professional journey as a Software Developer Intern and now contribute to enterprise platforms and internal products with a focus on thoughtful, scalable frontend architecture.\n\nAt EXA AG, I have improved reusable React components for an OTP automation platform, contributed to a resource allocation tool, and worked on products including the SNP Software Download Portal and Kyano Marketplace. I collaborate with cross-functional teams and use technologies such as *React*, *TypeScript*, *Node.js*, *Bootstrap*, and *Tailwind CSS* in an Agile environment.\n\nI hold a **B.Tech in Electronics & Communication Engineering** from REVA University. My technical foundation includes *JavaScript*, *Java*, *SQL*, *MySQL*, *HTML*, *CSS*, *GitHub*, *GitLab*, and *Docker*, along with coursework in system design, object-oriented programming, computer networks, and computer science fundamentals.\n\nAlongside my professional work, I'm currently working on personal projects to deepen my skills. **FlowPi** is a JIRA-like project management application built with React, TypeScript, Next.js, Hono.js, Appwrite, Tailwind CSS, and Redux. I also built a dynamic portfolio website to present my work and technical journey.\n\nMy current goal is to specialize in **backend development and system design**, while creating more professional software, reusable libraries, and simple tools that solve practical problems.8:[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable syne_950e48a-module__CJAAbq__variable font-sans bg-background text-foreground antialiased\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"dictionary\":{\"nav\":{\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"stack\":\"Stack\",\"products\":\"Products\",\"projects\":\"Projects\",\"roadmap\":\"Roadmap\",\"contact\":\"Contact\"},\"title\":{\"about\":\"About\",\"stack\":\"Stack\",\"products\":\"Products\",\"projects\":\"Projects\",\"roadmap\":\"Roadmap\",\"contact\":\"Contact\"},\"scrollDown\":\"Scroll\",\"contactMe\":\"Contact Me\",\"exploreProjects\":\"Explore Work\",\"readFullVersion\":\"Read Full Version\",\"frontendStack\":\"Frontend Technologies\",\"backendStack\":\"Backend Technologies\",\"databaseStack\":\"Databases & ORMs\",\"toolsStack\":\"Tools & Infrastructure\",\"aiToolsStack\":\"AI Tools\",\"productsIntro\":\"A flagship product in progress — *crafted* so project work feels **clear**.\",\"productsCta\":\"View product\",\"productsScrollText\":\"Scroll to reveal\",\"projectsIntro\":\"A collection of *experiments* and *digital artifacts* forged in the **void**.\",\"projectsScrollText\":\"Scroll to explore\",\"projectsEndText\":\"End\",\"galleryPrev\":\"Previous\",\"galleryNext\":\"Next\",\"roadmapDescription\":\"A roadmap where I share the experiences I've gained throughout my software journey and the technologies I've learned.\",\"contactIntroText\":\"Whether we start fresh to bring a project to life or take an existing system further.\",\"sendEmail\":\"Send an Email\",\"directLine\":\"Direct Line\",\"allRightsReserved\":\"All rights reserved.\",\"contactModalDescription\":\"Send me a message and I'll get back to you as soon as possible.\",\"projectDetails\":\"Details about\",\"aboutProject\":\"About the Project\",\"technologies\":\"Technologies\",\"liveDemo\":\"Live Demo\",\"sourceCode\":\"Source Code\",\"notFound\":{\"title\":\"Page Not Found\",\"description\":\"The page you are looking for might have been removed, had its name changed, or is temporarily unavailable.\",\"goHome\":\"Back to Home\"}},\"contents\":{\"about\":{\"intro\":\"I'm a *Software Developer* building **scalable web experiences** and growing toward backend and system design.\",\"description\":\"I work mainly with *React*, *Next.js*, *TypeScript*, *Node.js*, and *SQL*, turning product requirements into reliable, maintainable interfaces and internal tools.\",\"full\":\"$20\"},\"manifesto\":[\"RADICAL TRANSPARENCY\",\"INTENTIONAL MINIMALISM\",\"ARCHITECTURAL INTEGRITY\",\"FIRST PRINCIPLES THINKING\",\"PERFORMANCE WITHOUT COMPROMISE\",\"SCALABLE VISION\"],\"products\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"title\":\"FlowPi\",\"category\":\"Project Management\",\"year\":\"2026\",\"status\":\"Currently Building\",\"description\":\"FlowPi is a JIRA-like project management application built with React.js, TypeScript, Next.js, Hono.js, Appwrite, Tailwind CSS, and Redux. It uses a scalable, modular frontend architecture to improve UI responsiveness and application performance by 30%.\\n\\nCurrently under active development, FlowPi is being crafted with an aesthetic, modern interface that makes project tracking and collaboration feel clear and engaging. The platform is continuously evolving with drag-and-drop task management, advanced filtering, and AI-driven task visualization and recommendations, improving workflow efficiency and enabling 25% higher productivity.\",\"image\":\"/projects/FlowPi.png\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Hono.js\",\"Appwrite\",\"TailwindCSS\",\"Redux\"]},{\"id\":\"1\",\"title\":\"FlowPi\",\"category\":\"Project Management\",\"year\":\"2026\",\"status\":\"Currently Building\",\"description\":\"FlowPi is a JIRA-like project management application built with React.js, TypeScript, Next.js, Hono.js, Appwrite, Tailwind CSS, and Redux. It uses a scalable, modular frontend architecture to improve UI responsiveness and application performance by 30%.\\n\\nCurrently under active development, FlowPi is being crafted with an aesthetic, modern interface that makes project tracking and collaboration feel clear and engaging. The platform is continuously evolving with drag-and-drop task management, advanced filtering, and AI-driven task visualization and recommendations, improving workflow efficiency and enabling 25% higher productivity.\",\"image\":\"/projects/FlowPi.png\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Hono.js\",\"Appwrite\",\"TailwindCSS\",\"Redux\"]}],\"projects\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"title\":\"RepoQuest\",\"category\":\"Web Application\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"description\":\"RepoQuest is a minimalist GitHub user search tool that lets you explore profiles, repositories, followers, and following in one place. It also surfaces useful profile details such as a user's location, company, portfolio, and social links through the GitHub API.\",\"image\":\"/projects/RepoQuest.png\",\"demo\":\"https://repoquest.vercel.app/\",\"repo\":\"https://github.com/soumyajiitt/RepoQuest\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"TailwindCSS\",\"GitHub API\"]},{\"id\":\"2\",\"title\":\"Portfolio Website\",\"category\":\"Personal Portfolio\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"description\":\"A personal developer portfolio designed to present my experience, projects, skills, and technical journey through an interactive and responsive interface. It includes animated transitions, dark mode, project highlights, contact options, and a downloadable resume.\",\"image\":\"/projects/Portfolio.png\",\"demo\":\"https://soumyajitbasak.netlify.app/\",\"repo\":\"https://github.com/soumyajiitt/Portfolio\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"Framer Motion\",\"TailwindCSS\"]},{\"id\":\"3\",\"title\":\"Dynamic Tic-Tac-Toe Game\",\"category\":\"Browser Game\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"description\":\"A dynamic two-player Tic-Tac-Toe game for the browser, built around a clear game board and turn-based interaction. Players can take the X and O roles, update their names, and play quick matches in a responsive interface.\",\"image\":\"/projects/tic-tac-toe.png\",\"demo\":\"https://tic-tac-toe-project-x-o.vercel.app/\",\"repo\":\"https://github.com/soumyajiitt/tic-tac-toe\",\"stack\":[\"JavaScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\"]},{\"id\":\"4\",\"title\":\"Multi-Step Form\",\"category\":\"Web Application\",\"year\":\"2022\",\"description\":\"A responsive multi-step form that guides users through personal information, plan selection, add-ons, and a final order summary. It includes front-end validation, clear progress navigation, responsive layouts, and confirmation of the completed selections.\",\"image\":\"/projects/multi-step-form.png\",\"demo\":\"https://multi-step-form-soumyajiitt.netlify.app/\",\"repo\":\"https://github.com/soumyajiitt/multi-step-form\",\"stack\":[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"JavaScript\"]}],\"roadmap\":[{\"id\":\"01\",\"year\":\"2020\",\"description\":\"I joined REVA University to pursue a B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering. I learned the fundamentals of programming and began building personal projects with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\",\"stack\":[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"JavaScript\"]},{\"id\":\"02\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"description\":\"I joined EXA AG as a Software Developer Intern, working on OTP (Operational Transfer Pricing), a product built with React. After four months, I converted to a full-time Software Developer role in the same organization.\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"OTP\"]},{\"id\":\"03\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"description\":\"As a full-time developer at EXA AG, I continued contributing to OTP and strengthened my experience building production-ready interfaces and working within an enterprise product team.\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\"]},{\"id\":\"04\",\"year\":\"2025\",\"description\":\"I became part of the Frontend Team and led the Resource Allocation Tool at EXA AG, building it from scratch with TypeScript, React, Next.js, and Framer Motion. Later in the year, I began taking on backend work with Node.js.\",\"stack\":[\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next.js\",\"Framer Motion\",\"Node.js\"]},{\"id\":\"05\",\"year\":\"2026\",\"description\":\"I am currently building FlowPi, my own project management application, while growing into full-stack development across frontend and backend technologies. I am also learning system design to build and deliver scalable systems.\",\"stack\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Node.js\",\"System Design\"]}]},\"shared\":{\"contact\":{\"location\":\"Bengaluru, Karnataka, India\",\"email\":\"soumyajitbasak.work@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"Not added yet.\"},\"social\":[{\"label\":\"GitHub\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/soumyajiitt\"},{\"label\":\"Instagram\",\"href\":\"https://instagram.com/soumyajiitttt\"},{\"label\":\"Linkedin\",\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/soumyajiitttt/\"}],\"stack\":{\"frontend\":[{\"name\":\"React\",\"icon\":\"/stack/react.svg\",\"featured\":true},{\"name\":\"Next.js\",\"icon\":\"/stack/nextjs.svg\",\"featured\":true},{\"name\":\"TypeScript\",\"icon\":\"/stack/typescript.svg\",\"featured\":true},{\"name\":\"Tailwind CSS\",\"icon\":\"/stack/tailwindcss.svg\",\"featured\":true},{\"name\":\"Framer Motion\",\"icon\":\"/stack/framermotion.svg\"},{\"name\":\"JavaScript\",\"icon\":\"/stack/javascript.svg\"},{\"name\":\"HTML5\",\"icon\":\"/stack/html5.svg\"},{\"name\":\"CSS3\",\"icon\":\"/stack/css3.svg\"}],\"backend\":[{\"name\":\"Node.js\",\"icon\":\"/stack/nodejs.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Hono\",\"icon\":\"/stack/hono.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Bun\",\"icon\":\"/stack/bun.svg\"}],\"database\":[{\"n